@startuml
title UC04 - Trình tự Gửi lời mời kết bạn
actor "Người dùng" as User
participant "Flutter UI" as UI
participant "FriendClient" as FriendCli
participant "ApiService" as Api
participant "FriendController" as FriendCtrl
participant "FriendService (server)" as FriendSvc
database "MySQL" as DB

User -> UI: Nhấn "Kết bạn"
UI -> FriendCli: sendRequest(targetId)
FriendCli -> Api: POST /friends/requests
Api -> FriendCtrl: /friends/requests
FriendCtrl -> FriendSvc: createRequest(requesterId, targetId)
FriendSvc -> DB: INSERT friend_requests(pending)
DB --> FriendSvc: requestId
FriendSvc --> FriendCtrl: ok
FriendCtrl --> Api: 201
Api --> FriendCli: ok
FriendCli -> UI: Hiển thị trạng thái "Đã gửi"
@enduml